What the MIT License above does not cover

The Software, as the MIT License above uses the word, is Behold's code and its
documentation. It does not include the cases, the pictures, the sounds, or the
name, and the permission above grants no right in any of them.

The cases. Each case's own folder in src/cases/, such as src/cases/valley/,
with its text, its structure, and any briefs for its pictures; and the case
text wherever this repository copies it, such as the store listing in
android/listing.md, the tests, and the changelog.

The pictures. Every picture in this repository: the cases' in public/cases/,
the title's, public/title.jpg, and the icon's and the store listing's, in
public/icons/ and assets/.

The cases and the pictures are Copyright (c) 2026 garishay. All rights
reserved.

The sounds. Each file in public/audio/ is made from recordings by others,
under the terms docs/sound.md names for each: CC0 1.0 or CC BY 4.0.

The name. "Behold" and its icon name this game, and README.md reserves them.
